---
description: Mandatory repository-wide Alveus engineering rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Before any analysis, planning, or edits, read and follow the repository-root
`AGENTS.md`. It is the canonical policy for every coding agent.

Preserve existing user changes. Use a dedicated branch, focused diffs, regression
tests, the repository's current CI checks, and a dated
`docs/DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md` entry for every implementation PR. Never claim
unrun checks passed. Do not merge, install, change Plasma layout, or restart
plasmashell without explicit user approval. Do not log secrets or user file
contents. Do not duplicate or weaken the canonical rules in `AGENTS.md`.
